          <data key="d_label">netG.eval() ... netG.train()</data>
          <data key="d_definition">Wrap sampling/inference code with .eval() then restore .train() afterwards, so dropout/BN behave correctly during the sample step without disturbing the training loop. The GAN-generator-specific instance of this pattern.</data>
