        <node id="chain-rule-elementwise">
          <data key="d_id">chain-rule-elementwise</data>
          <data key="d_label">dL/dx = grad_out * d(out)/dx</data>
          <data key="d_definition">For an elementwise forward out = f(x), the backward is pointwise multiplication of grad_out with the local derivative; the Jacobian is diagonal so no sum/matmul required.</data>
