          <data key="d_label">bulk-register lambdas with unbroadcast</data>
          <data key="d_definition">For add/subtract/true_divide, the backwards are one-line lambdas: e.g. unbroadcast(g, x) for add-arg0, unbroadcast(-g, y) for sub-arg1, unbroadcast(g*(-x/y**2), y) for div-arg1.</data>
