          <data key="d_label">np.add.at(zeros_like(x), index, grad_out)</data>
          <data key="d_definition">Derivative of indexing x[index]: scatter grad_out into a zero tensor at the indexed positions, using np.add.at so repeated indices accumulate (not overwrite).</data>
