          <data key="d_label">shrink grad back to original shape</data>
          <data key="d_definition">When a forward op broadcast x to a larger shape, its backward must sum grad_out back down to x.shape to undo the broadcast. Two-step inverse: sum prepended dims, then sum size-1 dims with keepdims=True.</data>
          <data key="d_domain">broadcast-in-backward</data>
