          <data key="d_label">Parameter(Tensor(...)) two-step wrap</data>
          <data key="d_definition">Weights &amp; biases are created as Parameter(Tensor(np.random...)) so they're (a) ndarray-backed, (b) Tensor-wrapped, (c) Parameter-flagged.</data>
