          <data key="d_id">non-diff-fn-wrap</data>
          <data key="d_label">argmax/eq via wrap_forward_fn(is_differentiable=False)</data>
          <data key="d_definition">Non-differentiable ops still need wrapping (so unboxing works), but their outputs always have requires_grad=False and recipe=None.</data>
