          <data key="d_id">inplace-op-unsafe-warning</data>
          <data key="d_label">in-place mutation breaks recorded args</data>
          <data key="d_definition">Running add_ after a forward whose Recipe captured the pre-mutation array yields wrong gradients; torch raises, custom impl just warns. Why we generally avoid in-place during backprop.</data>
