          <data key="d_label">__rmul__ for 2 * tensor to dispatch correctly</data>
          <data key="d_definition">The Tensor class needs both __mul__ and __rmul__ so 2 * t (where Python first asks int.__mul__) falls through to the Tensor's reverse op.</data>
